170
00:08:58,510 --> 00:09:08,060
♪ When spring returns,
please raise a glass for me ♪

171
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:16,320
Spill it.

172
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,080
Whose idea was it?

173
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,480
Isn't it obvious?

174
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:20,870
Qi Shi,

175
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:23,120
you made that evil plan, right?

176
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:26,410
No one knows me better
than my own brother.

177
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,650
I was in on it too.

178
00:09:28,390 --> 00:09:29,850
You two seem pretty proud.

179
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,000
Yeah.

180
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:39,840
We were just trying to figure out...

181
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,120
Si,

182
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:45,240
do you still

183
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:49,030
like my brother, in a romantic way?

184
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:55,840
Qi Shi,

185
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:57,150
Cao Xin.

186
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:00,290
I know you both want

187
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:01,550
what's the best for us.

188
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,030
But right now,

189
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,130
I just want to focus on my job

190
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,000
and raise Doudou

191
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:09,360
through my own efforts.

192
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,380
I don't have the energy

193
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:13,160
to think about anything else.

194
00:10:13,550 --> 00:10:14,720
Do you not have the energy,

195
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,120
or are you just afraid to?

196
00:10:21,270 --> 00:10:21,910
Enough.

197
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:24,450
Stop giving Cao Si a hard time.

198
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:26,770
Let the bygones

199
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:28,530
be bygones.

200
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:32,210
Now, I just don't deserve her.

201
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,920
No, I'm the one who doesn't deserve you.

202
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,000
What are you two doing?

203
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,400
Playing out a melodrama?

204
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:40,810
What era are we in?

205
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,960
Who talks about who deserves who anymore?

206
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,620
Zhi, I have only one question.

207
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,450
Are you still into Cao Si or not?

208
00:10:57,670 --> 00:10:58,240
Yes, I am.

209
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,480
Si, do you still want

210
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,550
to be with Zhi?

211
00:11:06,030 --> 00:11:06,670
But...

212
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,080
No buts.

213
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:10,850
I approve of this match.

214
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,480
What about you? Do you approve of it?

215
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,610
Of course I do.

216
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,790
That said, don't get ahead

217
00:11:15,790 --> 00:11:16,520
of yourself.

218
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,700
This has to be run past by your mom.

219
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:27,390
No.

220
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,500
I'm firmly against it.

221
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:31,190
Mom, why do you have to...

222
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,240
Mom,

223
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:34,600
you watched Cao Si

224
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:35,360
grow up.

225
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:37,080
You know better than I do

226
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,200
what a great woman she is.

227
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:38,790
Why can't you

228
00:11:38,790 --> 00:11:39,750
just accept her?

229
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:43,880
She was married before.

230
00:11:44,870 --> 00:11:45,550
Now, she is

231
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,530
a divorcee with a child.

232
00:11:48,550 --> 00:11:49,870
There are so many women out there.

233
00:11:49,870 --> 00:11:50,860
Why can't you just

234
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:52,140
give up on her?

235
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:54,440
Mom, she's a divorcee,

236
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:55,670
and I'm an ex-convict.

237
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:57,330
That makes us a perfect match.

238
00:11:58,720 --> 00:11:59,240
And you're even

239
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,720
wearing a smile.

240
00:12:02,510 --> 00:12:03,840
Have you lost your mind?

241
00:12:04,170 --> 00:12:04,870
Don't you know

242
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:06,470
why you were put behind bars?

243
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:08,030
Why was I put behind bars?

244
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,240
Because I had to pay the price

245
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,790
of the mistake I made on impulse.

246
00:12:10,790 --> 00:12:12,520
It had nothing to do with Cao Si.

247
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:13,390
Mom,

248
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,910
I've never regretted

249
00:12:14,910 --> 00:12:16,030
getting together with Cao Si.

250
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:17,630
Now, I just want to give her

251
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:18,220
and Doudou

252
00:12:18,220 --> 00:12:19,390
a home where they can be safe.

253
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:20,650
Doudou is not your kid.

254
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:23,580
He's the son of that bastard Zhou Xuanyu!

255
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,750
Why do you have to

256
00:12:24,750 --> 00:12:25,750
involve yourself

257
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:26,550
in their mess?

258
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:30,510
Listen up!

259
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,550
Today, there's nothing you can say

260
00:12:32,550 --> 00:12:33,450
to change my mind.

261
00:12:33,450 --> 00:12:34,320
As I said before,

262
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,380
just give up on her!

263
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:37,680
And as I said before,

264
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,760
I am determined to be with Cao Si.

265
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:41,710
You... you...

266
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:42,720
Qi Zhi!

267
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,330
What a terrible kid.

268
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:50,120
So defiant.

269
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:51,200
I'm furious.

270
00:12:51,550 --> 00:12:52,480
Look at you.

271
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,910
Why get so worked up?

272
00:12:56,270 --> 00:12:58,200
You're blaming me too, aren't you?

273
00:12:59,650 --> 00:13:01,840
I just can't get over the past.

274
00:13:01,870 --> 00:13:02,550
You know?

275
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:04,430
I can't get over the past!

276
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:06,150
You keep asking me

277
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:06,910
why I wouldn't

278
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:07,390
put up

279
00:13:07,410 --> 00:13:08,790
a family photo in the living room

280
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:09,720
of our new house.

281
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,480
The reason is that I can't

282
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:14,460
bring myself to look at it.

283
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,600
I can't bring myself to recall

284
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,400
those glorious years of our son.

285
00:13:18,790 --> 00:13:20,050
You know what? When...

286
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,840
when I lie in bed at night,

287
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:22,530
everything

288
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,320
starts playing in my head like a movie,

289
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,240
scene by scene.

290
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,810
Without that incident,

291
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:31,240
even if our son couldn't stand

292
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,970
on the Olympic podium, would he

293
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:35,700
have been reduced
to the current situation?

294
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,440
How can I let it go?

295
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:46,200
It's always said that we should
leave the past in the past.

296
00:13:46,550 --> 00:13:49,200
But can I pretend
the whole thing never happened?

297
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,080
I know.

298
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:51,360
I understand.

299
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:55,000
Indeed, our son acted on impulse.

300
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,600
I did a bad job parenting him.

301
00:13:58,870 --> 00:13:59,320
But...

302
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,150
Who brought that bastard

303
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:02,680
Zhou Xuanyu into our lives?

304
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,370
It was Cao Si, right?

305
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,040
If it weren't for her,

306
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:07,740
would Zhi have

307
00:14:07,740 --> 00:14:09,450
gotten into fights and set fires?

308
00:14:09,450 --> 00:14:10,330
I just hate to

309
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,630
see them get together.

310
00:14:11,650 --> 00:14:12,720
Am I wrong?

311
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,800
No, you're not wrong.

312
00:14:16,060 --> 00:14:17,450
Alright, stop being mad.

313
00:14:17,450 --> 00:14:18,050
Come here.

314
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,360
Take a break. Come on.

315
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:29,720
Calm down.

316
00:14:45,670 --> 00:14:46,690
I watched Cao Si

317
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,720
grow up.

318
00:14:49,450 --> 00:14:50,410
I know

319
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,630
what she is like.

320
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:54,560
She really is a great woman.

321
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,570
When Cao Xin was little,

322
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:04,250
she was like a mother to him.

323
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:09,720
She played with him,

324
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:12,350
fed him, and wiped his mouth.

325
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:14,140
When others asked her out to play,

326
00:15:14,140 --> 00:15:15,540
she would always refuse,

327
00:15:17,030 --> 00:15:17,630
saying

328
00:15:18,550 --> 00:15:21,080
that she had to look after her brother
at home.

329
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,730
What Cao Xin has achieved today

330
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:29,390
is partly attributed to her.

331
00:15:34,740 --> 00:15:36,290
Is this destiny

332
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,200
or what?

333
00:15:39,590 --> 00:15:40,820
We switched our own son,

334
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:43,350
and now we're risking losing
our adopted son.

335
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,660
What kind of thinking is that?

336
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:47,970
This has nothing to do with that swap.

337
00:15:51,870 --> 00:15:53,000
Our son is a grown man

338
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:54,540
with his own ideas now.

339
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:58,160
We can't stop him from anything.

340
00:16:01,910 --> 00:16:02,440
How about

341
00:16:03,230 --> 00:16:04,690
we have a good talk with him

342
00:16:04,790 --> 00:16:06,000
some other time?

343
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,430
About that sweater

344
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,410
on the shelf over there,

345
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:36,030
I'd like to order

346
00:16:36,030 --> 00:16:36,600
some more

347
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:38,280
red yarn.

348
00:16:38,870 --> 00:16:39,400
How much?

349
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:41,080
Let me think about it.

350
00:17:00,630 --> 00:17:01,080
Hello?

351
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,090
How did it go?

352
00:17:04,030 --> 00:17:04,960
Did they say yes?

353
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,589
You know

354
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,680
my mom's temper.

355
00:17:09,829 --> 00:17:11,430
So this can't be an easy task.

356
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:12,609
But don't you worry.

357
00:17:12,930 --> 00:17:13,680
I'll find a way

358
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,010
to try to persuade them.

359
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,160
Qi Zhi, you know what?

360
00:17:28,030 --> 00:17:29,560
Although over these years,

361
00:17:30,590 --> 00:17:33,190
your family and mine
have no longer been close,

362
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:35,110
that day, Mrs. Huo still

363
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:36,480
stepped up to defend me

364
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,680
without hesitation.

365
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,300
She said this at the dinner table:

366
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,140
"I'm Cao Si's mother."

367
00:17:44,460 --> 00:17:46,060
Do you know how cool that was?

368
00:17:49,830 --> 00:17:50,880
For over 20 years,

369
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,830
that was the first time I heard

370
00:17:53,830 --> 00:17:55,030
something like that.

371
00:17:58,720 --> 00:17:59,450
To be honest,

372
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,750
Cao Xin and I really envied you and Shi

373
00:18:02,750 --> 00:18:03,880
when we were little.

374
00:18:05,470 --> 00:18:07,530
The mine was covered in dirt and dust.

375
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,880
Even just after a quick walk outside,

376
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:12,210
one's neck would be covered
in black soot.

377
00:18:12,750 --> 00:18:14,680
But you and Qi Shi were exceptions.

378
00:18:15,030 --> 00:18:16,070
Your clothes

379
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,480
were always clean.

380
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:20,400
Mrs. Huo even knitted

381
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,350
your sweaters and woolen pants

382
00:18:22,350 --> 00:18:23,750
in all sorts of patterns.

383
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:26,360
Back then, my mom always

384
00:18:26,510 --> 00:18:28,310
knitted an extra pair of sweaters.

385
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:29,570
If Qi Shi and I got some,

386
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:30,990
you and Cao Xin would too.

387
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,550
But she was too embarrassed to send them.

388
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,810
So later on, my dad had to
do the delivery.

389
00:18:37,510 --> 00:18:38,710
Given that, I will not

390
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:40,750
get together with you

391
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,620
without Mrs. Huo's approval.

392
00:18:45,350 --> 00:18:45,920
I know.

393
00:19:22,550 --> 00:19:22,920
Dad.

394
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:30,180
How's business today?

395
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:31,920
Not bad.

396
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:37,620
I'm off.

397
00:19:46,350 --> 00:19:46,850
What would you like?

398
00:19:46,850 --> 00:19:47,830
Two buns, please.

399
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:48,160
Okay.

400
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:15,310
Zhi.

401
00:20:16,060 --> 00:20:17,120
This is for Doudou.

402
00:20:20,590 --> 00:20:21,850
Mom knitted it, right?

403
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:25,200
The little flowers on the cuffs
are her signature.

404
00:20:29,030 --> 00:20:30,430
Years ago, Mom unraveled

405
00:20:31,550 --> 00:20:32,580
your old sweater

406
00:20:32,790 --> 00:20:33,680
to make me a new one.

407
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:35,110
And now, it has been passed

408
00:20:35,110 --> 00:20:37,110
down to Doudou, the third generation.

409
00:20:37,110 --> 00:20:37,840
Good for her.

410
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:39,310
The old lady wouldn't

411
00:20:39,510 --> 00:20:41,100
approve of me and Cao Si being together.

412
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:41,960
But she surely is diligent about

413
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:43,690
knitting sweaters for Doudou.

414
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:46,210
That's just how she is, isn't it?

415
00:20:46,210 --> 00:20:47,410
She never says

416
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:48,300
anything nice,

417
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,680
but the things she does

418
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:51,140
are always heartwarming.

419
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,010
Alright.

420
00:20:52,350 --> 00:20:53,640
Cao Si must've
picked up Doudou by now.

421
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:54,840
I'll take this to her.

422
00:20:56,110 --> 00:20:56,810
Where is Cao Xin?

423
00:20:56,810 --> 00:20:58,210
I haven't seen him today.

424
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:01,440
He's at the factory
keeping an eye on the progress.

425
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:02,450
I'm leaving.

426
00:21:03,350 --> 00:21:03,790
Look,

427
00:21:04,110 --> 00:21:06,000
with the scale and strength
of our factory,

428
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,400
there won't be a problem.

429
00:21:07,550 --> 00:21:08,830
These are all veteran employees
with 10 to 20 years

430
00:21:08,830 --> 00:21:09,690
of experience.

431
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,080
Look at

432
00:21:12,590 --> 00:21:13,670
the craftsmanship and stitching.

433
00:21:13,670 --> 00:21:14,400
Good, right?

434
00:21:15,510 --> 00:21:16,240
Yes, indeed.

435
00:21:17,030 --> 00:21:18,510
We will trust you with this season's

436
00:21:18,510 --> 00:21:19,570
new products then.

437
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:20,790
Rest assured,

438
00:21:20,790 --> 00:21:21,280
Cao.

439
00:21:21,730 --> 00:21:23,070
Our factory manufactures

440
00:21:23,070 --> 00:21:24,270
for big brands like Bolly.

441
00:21:24,270 --> 00:21:25,470
You know that, right?

442
00:21:25,940 --> 00:21:26,440
We promise to

443
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:27,880
deliver top-notch quality.

444
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,350
We guarantee to apply the same standards.

445
00:21:29,350 --> 00:21:30,680
Although Boss Qi

446
00:21:30,830 --> 00:21:31,920
is a bit demanding,

447
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,040
I'm sure we can

448
00:21:33,270 --> 00:21:34,130
meet your needs

449
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,220
through hard work.

450
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:36,330
Okay.

451
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:38,030
I'll wait to hear good news from you then.

452
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:38,400
Sure.

453
00:21:38,930 --> 00:21:40,000
I'll get back to work.

454
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:40,750
No need to see me out.

455
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:41,080
Okay.

456
00:21:46,550 --> 00:21:46,920
Dad.

457
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:51,450
Grandpa is in hospital now?

458
00:21:52,010 --> 00:21:53,140
I'll be right there.

459
00:21:53,310 --> 00:21:54,040
Okay, got it.

460
00:21:54,380 --> 00:21:59,800
[Haizhou No.1 People's Hospital]

461
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,400
How did it go?

462
00:22:10,110 --> 00:22:10,970
Is it finished?

463
00:22:11,750 --> 00:22:12,750
The doctor said

464
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,920
given Grandpa's current condition,

465
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,520
it's best to do a craniotomy.

466
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:18,720
But the surgery carries certain risks.

467
00:22:18,720 --> 00:22:20,180
Your signature is needed.

468
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:24,900
When should I sign the papers?

469
00:22:25,200 --> 00:22:26,530
The sooner, the better.

470
00:22:31,310 --> 00:22:31,790
Okay.

471
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:34,590
I'll do it as soon as I can.

472
00:22:34,590 --> 00:22:36,070
Tell her to come.

473
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:40,410
Grandpa,

474
00:22:41,110 --> 00:22:42,440
Si is on the way.

475
00:22:43,730 --> 00:22:45,830
Tell Qi Shi to come.

476
00:22:50,350 --> 00:22:51,720
Go ahead and make a call.

477
00:22:53,300 --> 00:22:54,760
I'll call Qi Shi right now.

478
00:22:56,030 --> 00:22:56,680
Okay.

479
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:38,400
Qi Shi!

480
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,270
Your place is a pigsty.

481
00:23:41,270 --> 00:23:42,640
It's such a mess, really.

482
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:43,900
If you can't take care of yourself,

483
00:23:43,900 --> 00:23:45,000
just pack up and go home.

484
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,450
Even sleeping on the floor
is better than this.

485
00:23:46,450 --> 00:23:48,200
I've been busy lately.
It's not always like this.

486
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:48,550
What?

487
00:23:49,110 --> 00:23:50,030
You want it to be like this?

488
00:23:50,030 --> 00:23:52,030
It's not always like this. I'm busy.

489
00:23:52,310 --> 00:23:53,310
Busy, busy, busy.

490
00:23:53,310 --> 00:23:54,440
You're a grown woman,

491
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:55,770
and all you know is work.

492
00:23:55,920 --> 00:23:57,250
You live in the suburbs,

493
00:23:57,270 --> 00:23:58,420
staring at a computer all day.

494
00:23:58,420 --> 00:23:59,310
Your eyes are bad enough.

495
00:23:59,310 --> 00:24:00,770
You need to rest, you know?

496
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:02,640
And you don't eat properly.

497
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:03,720
Look how skinny you are.

498
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:04,420
You'll never get married.

499
00:24:04,420 --> 00:24:05,550
Whether I get married or not
is none of your concern.

500
00:24:05,550 --> 00:24:06,200
Okay?

501
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,720
Don't touch my clothes.

502
00:24:09,750 --> 00:24:11,600
I put them there on purpose.

503
00:24:13,060 --> 00:24:14,070
Why leave clothes out if you're

504
00:24:14,070 --> 00:24:15,020
not going to fold them?

505
00:24:15,020 --> 00:24:16,870
For photos. You wouldn't get it.

506
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,310
You don't get anything,

507
00:24:19,310 --> 00:24:20,400
but you have to control everything.

508
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,200
I don't get it.

509
00:24:21,350 --> 00:24:22,550
I don't get anything.

510
00:24:23,270 --> 00:24:24,160
I brought you food here.

511
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:25,360
Hello? What's wrong?

512
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:26,750
Eat it or don't.

513
00:24:26,750 --> 00:24:28,480
If you don't, I'll take it away.

514
00:24:28,790 --> 00:24:30,000
You eat this junk all day.

515
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:30,400
Me?

516
00:24:31,320 --> 00:24:32,780
It has no nutrition at all.

517
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:34,590
I-I got it.

518
00:24:34,590 --> 00:24:35,720
I'll be right there.

519
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:37,680
Stop cleaning up, Mom.

520
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:38,640
Cao Xin said

521
00:24:38,750 --> 00:24:40,130
Grandpa Cao is dying.

522
00:24:40,590 --> 00:24:41,790
He's asking to see me.

523
00:24:43,470 --> 00:24:44,070
What?

524
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,790
What happened to Grandpa Cao?

525
00:24:45,790 --> 00:24:48,050
Brain hemorrhage. He's in the hospital.

526
00:24:48,070 --> 00:24:48,440
Mom.

527
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:49,400
Let's go.

528
00:24:49,400 --> 00:24:49,800
Why...

529
00:24:50,350 --> 00:24:51,960
Why does he want to see you?

530
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:53,990
How would I know?

531
00:24:54,050 --> 00:24:54,790
Leave it alone.

532
00:24:54,790 --> 00:24:55,350
Let's go.

533
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:56,440
No, no,

534
00:24:57,270 --> 00:24:57,680
wait.

535
00:24:59,070 --> 00:24:59,880
Y-Your dad said

536
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:00,750
he's coming over later.

537
00:25:00,750 --> 00:25:01,510
I'll wait for him.

538
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:02,200
You go first.

539
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:02,680
-You go first.
-I'll go first.

540
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:03,350
You two lock the door.

541
00:25:03,350 --> 00:25:03,960
Okay.

542
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,420
I'm at Qi Shi's.

543
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:25,700
Come over quickly.

544
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:28,310
Just come. Don't ask so many questions.

545
00:25:28,310 --> 00:25:28,990
Hurry up.

546
00:25:50,750 --> 00:25:51,400
You're here.

547
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:51,880
Uncle.

548
00:25:52,510 --> 00:25:54,210
My mom's waiting for my dad.

549
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:55,440
They'll be here soon.

550
00:25:57,110 --> 00:25:58,510
Grandpa wants to see you.

551
00:26:00,070 --> 00:26:00,600
Grandpa.

552
00:26:01,310 --> 00:26:01,720
Dad.

553
00:26:02,830 --> 00:26:03,680
Qi Shi is here.

554
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:08,640
Grandpa.

555
00:26:10,440 --> 00:26:12,360
Grandpa, I came to see you.

556
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:16,310
Shi,

557
00:26:18,350 --> 00:26:19,200
you're here.

558
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,750
I'm useless now.

559
00:26:24,830 --> 00:26:26,110
I'm so sorry.

560
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:30,270
I can't make you chicken soup anymore.

561
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:33,240
Don't be sorry.

562
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:36,000
You've been in Haizhou so long,

563
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,460
and I never came to see you.

564
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:39,030
I'm sorry.

565
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:42,480
Get well soon

566
00:26:42,510 --> 00:26:43,640
and make me chicken soup.

567
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,300
You hear me?

568
00:26:45,310 --> 00:26:45,830
Okay.

569
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:48,960
Cao Xin.

570
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:53,410
Grandpa.

571
00:26:54,160 --> 00:26:55,160
This is great.

572
00:27:01,310 --> 00:27:02,350
Leave us.

573
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:06,270
I need to talk to the kids.

574
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:09,000
Dad, save—

575
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:09,640
Go.

576
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:18,410
Careful.

577
00:27:22,070 --> 00:27:22,640
Grandpa.

578
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:43,750
Shi.

579
00:27:46,200 --> 00:27:48,750
I've forgotten a lot of things.

580
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:54,070
But there's one thing

581
00:27:55,790 --> 00:27:57,750
I've been keeping to myself.

582
00:29:22,000 --> 00:29:22,800
